    Fix `ResourceAny` conversion of synthetic borrowed host resources (#14384)
    
    Converting a `Resource::new_borrow` (or `ResourceDynamic::new_borrow`)
    into a `ResourceAny` eagerly inserted a borrow into the host resource
    table. That requires an active component call scope, so doing it
    outside of a call reached `bail_bug!("no current scope")`.
    
    Defer the borrow instead: `ResourceAny` now carries either a host table
    index or, for a synthetic borrow, the raw `rep`. The synthetic variant
    has no host table state, so conversion, typed round-trip and
