    the caller awaits the result outside of `Accessor::with`. Running the
    destructor on the worker fiber keeps guest code off the embedder's
    stack, and `resource_drop_impl` is shared unchanged so resource table
    handling, `may_enter` checks, and sync-call bookkeeping are identical to
    the sync and async variants.
    
