      side-effecting" sentinel. This replaces hash probing with array indexing and
      lets `get_value_as_source_or_const` and `lower_clif_block` reuse one dense
      read for both the side-effect test and the color, dropping a redundant
      `has_lowering_side_effect` recompute per source instruction.
    
