    backend `icmp+brif` fusion to produce:
    
      x86_64  brif (ctz X):   `testl $1, %edi; je`
      x86_64  brif (clz X):   `testl %edi, %edi; jge`
      aarch64 brif (ctz X):   `tbz w0, #0` — single-instruction test-and-branch
    
